    "details": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"g9hr8\" data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"161\"><strong>Opportunity Description</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"237\"><strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"237\">Build with Techroom. Innovate with Google Technologies. Create Impact.</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"442\">Techroom brings an exciting opportunity for students, developers, and technology enthusiasts to <strong data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"389\">build innovative solutions for real-world problems</strong> using modern technologies from the Google ecosystem.</li>\n<li data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"666\">Participants will get the opportunity to explore and build with technologies such as <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"665\">Google Cloud, Vertex AI, BigQuery, Firebase, Cloud Storage, Google Maps Platform, Looker, Gemini, Google OAuth, and Google Cloud Run</strong>.</li>\n<li data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"855\">The initiative focuses on transforming ideas into <strong data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"787\">secure, intelligent, scalable, and impactful technology solutions</strong>&mdash;with a vision of building a <strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"854\">safer, smarter, and stronger India</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"1nofgx5\" data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"882\"><strong>What You Can Build</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"1122\">\n<li data-section-id=\"cp9fy7\" data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"911\">AI/ML-powered solutions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jedsrm\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"941\">️ Cloud-based applications</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1s913w9\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"981\">Data-driven intelligence platforms</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"199vj3f\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1012\">️ Location-based solutions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4dvxvv\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1041\">Secure web applications</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15gh21p\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1080\">Predictive analytics &amp; dashboards</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1vcx7ru\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1122\">Scalable full-stack web applications</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"iaqlew\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1147\"><strong>Why Participate?</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1420\">\n<li data-section-id=\"18zl0gv\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1206\">Gain hands-on experience with modern Google technologies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r2a8ye\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1247\">Solve meaningful real-world challenges</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1nb2v2k\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1288\">Build and showcase a working prototype</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"img6rx\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1345\">Strengthen your development and problem-solving skills</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19fzpe4\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1420\">Get an opportunity to showcase your innovation to the Techroom community</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1506\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1457\">Think. Build. Innovate. Impact.</strong><br data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" /><strong data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1506\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Powered by Techroom &times; Google Technologies.</strong></p>",
